    m_Alignment: 3
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'This is an example scene to show how a save UI may work in a project.

    On
    the right it holds all previous saves and in the center of the screen it has
    a input field and a

    button to save the current state of the scene. On the
    left you can see a text field that you can type in

    to mimic a game save.
    When a save is present a new object will be created in the scrol rect on the
    right.

    When you load a specific save it should repopulate the text field
    with the saved value.'
